      "raw_text": "South of Southern Mexico:\nAn area of low pressure is forecast to form well offshore of \nsouthern Mexico within a couple of days. Environmental conditions \nappear conducive for gradual development thereafter, and a tropical \ndepression is likely to form around the middle of next week while \nit moves westward to west-northwestward, well south of Mexico. \n* Formation chance through 48 hours...low...near 0 percent. \n* Formation chance through 7 days...high...80 percent.",
